  "evidencia": "Page: Craig Nicholls. Sentence: Craig Robert Nicholls (born 31 August 1977) is an Australian musician, best known as the lead singer, songwriter, and guitarist of the Australian alternative rock band The Vines, of which he is the only mainstay member.\nPage: Norman Blake (Scottish musician). Sentence: Norman Blake (born 20 October 1965, Bellshill, North Lanarkshire, Scotland) is a singer, instrumentalist and songwriter in the Glasgow based band Teenage Fanclub.\nPage: Wicked Nature. Sentence: The release marks a few milestones for The Vines, with frontman Craig Nicholls taking on the role of producer for the first time, as well as introducing a completely new rhythm section with drummer Lachlan West and bassist Tim John.",
