        "original_id": "d9ee64d7-ef3c-5704-9aaf-f07a13e53245",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Craig Nicholls, Norman Blake, Lachlan West, Tim John\n- Bands: The Vines, Teenage Fanclub\n- Albums: Wicked Nature\n- Roles: lead singer, songwriter, guitarist, producer, drummer, bassist, instrumentalist\n- Places: Australia, Bellshill, North Lanarkshire, Scotland, Glasgow\n\nFacts:\n- Norman Blake was born on 20 October 1965 in Bellshill, North Lanarkshire, Scotland.\n- Craig Robert Nicholls was born on 31 August 1977.\n- Norman Blake is a singer, instrumentalist, and songwriter in the Glasgow-based band Teenage Fanclub.\n- Craig Nicholls is an Australian musician best known as the lead singer, songwriter, and guitarist of the Australian alternative rock band The Vines.\n- Craig Nicholls is the only mainstay member of The Vines.\n- Wicked Nature marked Craig Nicholls's first time serving as producer for The Vines.\n- Wicked Nature introduced a new rhythm section for The Vines with drummer Lachlan West and bassist Tim John.",
